1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,557
In an adiabatic change, no heat enters or leaves.

2
00:00:04,557 --> 00:00:09,700
That needs thick insulation, or a change so fast that heat has no time to flow.

3
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:18,151
The compression stroke of a diesel engine, and the squeezes and stretches in a sound wave, are both effectively adiabatic.

